1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Check engine light on?
It might just be your gas cap.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000
A gas cap that isn't clicked
all the way can trip it.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Modern engines watch
for fuel vapor leaks,

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
and a loose seal can mimic
a real problem.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
That can mask a code
that actually matters,

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
or contribute to
a failed emissions check.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,000
One clue isn't a diagnosis —

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
worth checking before
you assume the worst.

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Stop by and we'll take a look —
Nick's Tire and Auto, on Euclid Avenue.
